        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 24 at 2:50AM EDT until September 26 at 8:00AM EDT by NWS Melbourne FL</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Seas 7 to 10 feet expected.

* WHERE...Sebastian Inlet to Jupiter Inlet 0-20 nm and Sebastian
Inlet to Jupiter Inlet 20-60 nm.

* WHEN...From 8 PM this evening to 8 AM EDT Saturday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.</instruction>
